class_name CodexData
# The book's entries (scripts/codex.gd; texts in scripts/codex_txt.gd).
#   cat     struct | device | mech | sys
#   arts    device: the drawings (art ids) it covers; mech: its key machines
#   names   mech: the kinds of piece (name_key) that show it
#   joints / lines / kinds / ctrls   struct: what is pointed at
#   inc     incidents that show it
#   ev      sys: what the berth does that shows it (Codex._event)
#   ships   mech: the ships it is on; cls: its special course
#   draw    the drawing on its card (default: the first art); glyph: a sign instead
#   size    the drawing's proportions [w, h]; marks: [[x, y]] points called out (0..1)
#   always  struct / sys: counted as "on this ship" for every ship

